  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_04_dragonbb_01",
      "hash64": "0A40DA9D4A894A22",
      "text": "嗯～\\n差不多就在这儿吧～[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_04_dragonbb_02",
      "hash64": "0A40D99D4A89486F",
      "text": "话说[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你对战的身姿……[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_04_dragonbb_03",
      "hash64": "0A40D89D4A8946BC",
      "text": "我好像只从\\n对战场外面见过。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_04_dragonbb_04",
      "hash64": "0A40D79D4A894509",
      "text": "像这样和你正面交锋\\n还是第一次呢～[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_04_dragonbb_05",
      "hash64": "0A40D69D4A894356",
      "text": "蓝莓联盟……[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]哥姐们你\\n要是赢不了呀～我就头疼了。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_04_dragonbb_06",
      "hash64": "0A40D59D4A8941A3",
      "text": "很头疼……\\n非常～头疼！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_04_dragonbb_07",
      "hash64": "0A40D49D4A893FF0",
      "text": "……但话虽这么说。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_04_dragonbb_08",
      "hash64": "0A40E39D4A89596D",
      "text": "要是现在放水的话，\\n我的乐子就没了。\\r\\n所以我也会拿出点干劲的。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_04_dragonbb_09",
      "hash64": "0A40E29D4A8957BA",
      "text": "……不过！\\n也不需要搞得那么严肃。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_04_dragonbb_10",
      "hash64": "0A3D559D4A86324C",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你\\n只要像平常一样对战就行啦。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_04_dragonbb_11",
      "hash64": "0A3D569D4A8633FF",
      "text": "阿若我觉得啊～\\n非常兴奋哦。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_04_dragonbb_12",
      "hash64": "0A3D579D4A8635B2",
      "text": "那好～\\n我们差不多开始吧～[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_04_dragonbb_13",
      "hash64": "0A3D589D4A863765",
      "text": "一起玩个痛快吧，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]哥姐们！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_04_dragonbb_14",
      "hash64": "0A3D519D4A862B80",
      "text": "嘿嘿嘿！\\n真是太痛快啦～[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_04_dragonbb_15",
      "hash64": "0A3D529D4A862D33",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]……\\n真高兴我拉[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]哥姐们你进了联盟社～[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_04_dragonbb_16",
      "hash64": "0A3D539D4A862EE6",
      "text": "既然你打赢了我呀～\\n那就得正式入社才行啊！\\r\\n对吧！？没问题吧～！？[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_04_dragonbb_17",
      "hash64": "0A3D549D4A863099",
      "text": "嘿嘿嘿！\\n真爽快！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_04_dragonbb_18",
      "hash64": "0A3D5D9D4A863FE4",
      "text": "别小里小气的啦！\\n你虽然嘴上这么说，\\r\\n其实内心……对吧～！？[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_04_dragonbb_19",
      "hash64": "0A3D5E9D4A864197",
      "text": "那好～我们来拍一下\\n社员名册用的照片吧～！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_04_dragonbb_20",
      "hash64": "0A47E79D4A8F7EE7",
      "text": "……照片拍得太胡闹，\\n感觉要挨紫竽的骂了。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_04_dragonbb_21",
      "hash64": "0A47E69D4A8F7D34",
      "text": "好像……还有点什么来着。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_04_dragonbb_22",
      "hash64": "0A47E99D4A8F824D",
      "text": "要送招式学习器\\n给打败四天王的家伙来着？[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_04_dragonbb_23",
      "hash64": "0A47E89D4A8F809A",
      "text": "我没带在身上，\\n稍微等我一下啊。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_04_clerk_npc",
      "hash64": "FE43F66BFAD1E3D8",
      "text": "恭喜你战胜\\n四天王杜若！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
